{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12696","headline":"宴湖上亭作 · 元结","name":"宴湖上亭作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"广亭盖小湖，湖亭实清旷。\n轩窗幽水石，怪异尤难状。\n石尊能寒酒，寒水宜初涨。\n岸曲坐客稀，桮浮上摇漾。\n远水入帘幕，淅[沥]吹酒舫。\n欲去未回时，飘飘正堪望。\n酣兴思共醉，促酒更相向。\n舫去若惊凫，溶瀛满湖浪。\n朝来暮忘返，暮归独惆怅。\n谁肯爱林泉，从吾老湖上。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12696.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12696","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}